      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'll add even more: when you alt+tab or esc or anything - your horizontal view movement is locked, but vertical remains unblocked. Why? And it is not the minimum mouse input along axis. The mouselook itself here is completely screwed up. Granted, i know this is aimed for VR more than desktop. But how can such simple feature as mouselook be implemented so badly? It only \"reads\" mouse, when the actuall physical mouse on your mousepad has moved enough per frame. So if i move it very slowly - view angles will never change. I guess devs should learn there is something called a \"between frames\" thing :)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
