  "details": "This problem became manifest when I was painting using desktop mode with my friend and pen.\nEven if the pen is carefully input with a slight movement, the left and right turns are regarded as not being input,\nIt was as dirty as if the straight line correction was working.\nTo show friends the beautiful picture you wrote with a mouse, you should unify the minimum input decision of the mouse with X and Y. (Preferably in Y direction)\n\nThe image shows how unnatural input judgment is made.\nI am using the model G400 without linear correction, but you can see that it draws a straight vertical line.",
